<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Personnel File: THE JESTER | Restricted Access</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Special+Elite&family=Courier+Prime:wght@400;700&family=Roboto+Slab:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --olive: #4B5320;
            --olive-dark: #353b16;
            --tan: #d2c5a7;
            --paper: #e4dec7;
            --ink: #1a1a1b;
            --stamp-red: rgba(169, 29, 17, 0.85);
            --tape: rgba(210, 195, 140, 0.5);
            --redacted: #1a1a1b;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--tan);
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 2px 2px, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 1px, transparent 0);
            background-size: 30px 30px;
            color: var(--ink);
            font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
            line-height: 1.4;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .dossier-page {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: var(--paper);
            padding: 60px;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 5px 5px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border: 1px solid #c4bc9d;
        }

        .dossier-page::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/paper-fibers.png');
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.3;
        }

        .staple {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            width: 40px;
            height: 10px;
            background: #999;
            transform: rotate(-35deg);
            opacity: 0.6;
            border-radius: 2px;
            box-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            z-index: 30;
        }

        .confidential-stamp {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50px;
            right: 50px;
            border: 5px double var(--stamp-red);
            color: var(--stamp-red);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-family: 'Special Elite', cursive;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            transform: rotate(-15deg);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            opacity: 0.8;
            z-index: 20;
        }

        .header-box {
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .file-number {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .subject-name {
            font-family: 'Special Elite', cursive;
            font-size: 3rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .bio-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .photo-area {
            position: relative;
        }

        .profile-photo {
            width: 100%;
            height: 300px;
            background: #ccc;
            border: 10px solid white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            filter: sepia(0.5) contrast(1.2);
            position: relative;
        }

        .photo-tape {
            position: absolute;
            width: 100px;
            height: 30px;
            background: var(--tape);
            top: -15px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(2deg);
            z-index: 5;
        }

        .data-point {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px dotted #999;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .label {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--olive-dark);
            display: inline-block;
            width: 120px;
        }

        .redacted {
            background: var(--redacted);
            color: var(--redacted);
            padding: 0 4px;
            cursor: help;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .redacted:hover {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        .narrative-section {
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .narrative-section h3 {
            font-family: 'Roboto Slab', serif;
            background: var(--ink);
            color: var(--paper);
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 2px 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .typewriter-text {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            text-align: justify;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .mission-statement {
            background: rgba(75, 83, 32, 0.1);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--olive);
            padding: 20px;
            font-style: italic;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .handwritten {
            font-family: 'Special Elite', cursive;
            color: #2a3a6a;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            transform: rotate(-1deg);
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .footer-sig {
            margin-top: 60px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
            padding-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        .ink-smudge-large {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 40px;
            right: 40px;
            width: 150px;
            height: 120px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .bio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .dossier-page { padding: 30px; }
            .confidential-stamp { position: relative; top: 0; right: 0; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="dossier-page">
        <div class="staple"></div>
        <div class="confidential-stamp">Level 4 Clearance</div>
        
        <div class="header-box">
            <p class="file-number">REF NO: VJ-DISPATCH-77-ALPHA</p>
            <h1 class="subject-name">The Jester</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="bio-grid">
            <div class="photo-area">
                <div class="photo-tape"></div>
                <div class="profile-photo">
                    <span style="transform: rotate(-10deg); opacity: 0.5;">PHOTO REDACTED<br>BY ORDER OF O-6</span>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <div class="data-point"><span class="label">Status:</span> Active Duty (Satire)</div>
                    <div class="data-point"><span class="label">Location:</span> <span class="redacted">Mojave Sector 4</span></div>
                    <div class="data-point"><span class="label">Affiliation:</span> None / Freelance</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bio-details">
                <div class="data-point"><span class="label">Service:</span> US Army // Infantry</div>
                <div class="data-point"><span class="label">Rank:</span> <span class="redacted">Sergeant First Class</span></div>
                <div class="data-point"><span class="label">Deployments:</span> <span class="redacted">OIF / OEF / Corporate HR</span></div>
                <div class="data-point"><span class="label">Specialty:</span> Psychological Resilience</div>
                <div class="data-point"><span class="label">Primary Tool:</span> IBM Selectric (Modified)</div>
                
                <div class="narrative-section">
                    <h3>Origin Story</h3>
                    <p class="typewriter-text">
                        The subject began his career in the mud, learning that humor is the only armor that doesn't add weight to your rucksack. After <span class="redacted">twelve years of service</span> and a series of questionable decisions involving a commanding officer's parade vehicle, the subject transitioned to the private sector.
                    </p>
                    <p class="typewriter-text">
                        Finding the "civilian world" to be populated by the same species of bureaucrats and power-trippers found in the military—only with less accountability and worse coffee—he founded the **Veteran Jester Dispatch**.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="narrative-section">
            <h3>The Mission</h3>
            <div class="mission-statement">
                "To provide tactical-level satire for the modern individual caught in the crossfire of corporate absurdity, political theater, and the general erosion of common sense. We fight the war against 'The Bullshit' by laughing at it until it loses its power."
            </div>
            <p class="typewriter-text">
                Subject is currently engaged in unauthorized truth-telling and high-velocity commentary. He specializes in the intersection of <span class="redacted">combat-tested leadership</span> and the utter chaos of modern liberty. Warning: Content may contain traces of gallows humor and unfiltered reality.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="handwritten">
            Note: Do not attempt to "onboard" this individual. He has already burned the orientation manual.
        </div>

        <div class="ink-smudge-large"></div>

        <div class="footer-sig">
            <span>SIGNATURE: __________________________</span>
            <span>DATE: 22-OCT-20XX</span>
            <span>CONTROL: VJ-99</span>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html><!DOCTYPE html>
